# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vyom — environment variable template
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored and must never be
# committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# PHASE 0: no variables are required. The application runs with none of these
# set. Each entry below is commented out and documents where it becomes
# required, so the structure exists before the phase that needs it.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the browser bundle and are PUBLIC.
# Never give a secret a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Application ------------------------------------------------------------

# Absolute base URL of this deployment. Used for absolute links and callbacks.
# Optional locally; set it in Vercel for preview and production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"


# --- Database (Phase 2) -----------------------------------------------------
# Supabase Postgres. DATABASE_URL is the pooled connection used at runtime;
# DIRECT_URL is the direct connection Prisma needs for migrations.
# SECRET — server only.

# DATABASE_URL=""
# DIRECT_URL=""


# --- Supabase (Phase 3) -----------------------------------------------------
# URL and anon key are browser-safe: the anon key is designed for client use and
# is constrained by Row Level Security policies.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=""
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""

# SECRET — server only. Bypasses Row Level Security entirely. Never import this
# into a client component, and never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""


# --- Email (later phase) ----------------------------------------------------
# Transactional email for invitations and verification. SECRET — server only.

# RESEND_API_KEY=""


# --- Payments (Phase 16) ----------------------------------------------------
# Razorpay. The key ID is public; the key secret and webhook secret are not.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=""
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=""
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
